scenario.en:
from collections.abc import Sequence

def a(animals: list[Animal]) -> None:
    animals.append(Cat())

def b(animals: Sequence[Animal]) -> None:
    for x in animals: x.feed()

def c(handler: Callable[[Dog], None]) -> None:
    handler(Dog())

dogs: list[Dog] = [Dog()]
a(dogs)
b(dogs)
c(lambda an: feed_any(an))   # feed_any: (Animal) -> None

Which of a(dogs), b(dogs), and the c(...) call pass the checker?

